# Expense Tracker
This script is for making a lost of expenses and calling pre written fucntions to be able to sort all the data within the list and filter what you need from it.

## What it does
- creates and saves an ammendable list
- can filter through the data within the list for ease of use and readability

## Running it

    git clone git@github.com:thomaslongworth2000-rgb/terminal-toolkit.git
    cd project
    python3 -m venv .venv
    source .venv/bin/activate
    pip install -r requirements.txt
    python3 main.py

